# MediCat Installer — C++ Win32 Application

## Project Overview

Native Windows installer for MediCat USB bootable media. **Active development is on the `cpp` branch** (`MedicatInstaller.exe`). Older branches exist for reference:

| Branch | Stack | Status |
|--------|-------|--------|
| `cpp` | C++17 / Win32 / CMake | **Active** — experimental prerelease |
| `pwsh` | PowerShell 7 + WinForms | Legacy alpha |
| `main` | Batch scripts | Community maintenance |

The C++ installer handles Ventoy install/upgrade, optional NTFS format, `MediCat.USB.v21.12.7z` extraction, MD5 verification, and selective re-extract on verify failure. Tools (`7za.exe`, `MedicatFiles.md5`) are **embedded in the exe** (one `7za` per build arch) and extracted to `%TEMP%\MedicatInstaller\{pid}\` at runtime.

**Docs:** [`README.md`](README.md) · [`FEATURES.md`](FEATURES.md) · [`TODO.md`](TODO.md) · [`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)

